Grover rents 3,000+ consumer electronics (smartphones, laptops, VR, wearables) with flexible 1-18 month terms at 3-4% of purchase price monthly. After each return, devices undergo professional refurbishment with quality checks and repairs before redeployment. Grover has cycled 1.2+ million devices an average of 4-5 times each. This use-oriented model reduces consumption pressure, extends device lifespan through repeated cycles, and aligns profitability with device durability rather than replacement frequency.